# The extension is one esbuild bundle that inlines its dependencies and claude-plugin/store.mjs,
# so the package needs only the manifest, the bundle, the icon the manifest points at, and the
# licenses that have to travel with the code inside it: Clause's own and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for
# the inlined dependencies. images/icon.svg is the master the PNG is rendered from; it stays in the
# repository.
# Naming what to keep means a new folder (tests, scratch output, source maps) cannot end up in
# the package by accident.
**
!package.json
!dist/extension.js
!images/icon.png
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
